# Poteto mode by default

Non-trivial work (feature, bug fix, refactor, investigation, perf, PR, cloud or overnight run) starts by loading the **poteto-mode** skill and following it. The skill is `disable-model-invocation`, so it never attaches on its own; read it, then let it drive. Its own reminder decides which turns are casual enough to skip.

Reading the skill is the trigger. Writing in poteto's style without loading it is not poteto mode.
